Jaha'n jaha'n hussain hai<br>
waha'n waha'n hai karbala<br>
jaha'n jaha'n hai karbala<br>
waha'n waha'n hussain hai<br>
zamana aaj dekhle<br>
kaha'n kaha'n husssain hai<br>
hussain ya hussain..(4)<br>
<br>
Zamee'n se aasma'n talak<br>
sadaye ya hussain hai<br>
<br>
1. Jaha bhi hoga zikr e haq inhi ka naam aayega<br>
uthegi bus yehi sada yehi payaam aayega<br>
shahadato mein jab koi kada maqaam aayega<br>
batao razm e ghair o sharr mein (kaun kaam aayega)..(2)<br>
har ek razm e ghair o sharr ke darmiyaa'n hussain hai<br>
<br>
2. Kahi pe unki goonj hai kahi'n pe unka naam hai<br>
likha hua furaat ki jabee'n pe unka naam hai<br>
jaha'n jaha'n juloos hai wahi'n pe unka naam hai<br>
alam bhi keh raha hai ye (zamee'n pe unka naam hai)..(2)<br>
alam ki in bulandiyo se jawedaa'n hussain hai<br>
<br>
3. Payam e kirdigaar ko amar karegi karbala<br>
tamam ehle dard par asar karegi karbala<br>
har ek dil ki dhadkano mein ghar karegi karbala<br>
har ek daur mein yuhi (safar karegi karbala)..(2)<br>
kabhi na hogi khatm jo wo daasta'n hussain hai<br>
<br>
4. Bazahir ab nahi rahe zamee'n pe inke jism o jaa'n<br>
ufak ufak pe dekhiye kaha'n nahi hai wo yaha'n<br>
tamaam ehle haq pe hai inhi ki sar parastiya'n<br>
khade hai maqtalo mein jo (unhi pe hai ye meherbaa'n)..(2)<br>
inhi azeem manzaro ke paasbaa'n hussain hai<br>
<br>
5. Hussain ka qayam hai ana minal hussain se<br>
hussain ko dawaam hai ana minal husssain se<br>
nabi ka zikr e aam hai ana minal hussain se<br>
ye aakhri payaam hai (ana minal hussain se)..(2)<br>
isi payaam e akhri ke tarjumaa'n hussain hai<br>
<br>
6. Lahu gale se beh gaya magar kalaam reh gaya<br>
jaha'n mein isteghasa e labe imam reh gaya<br>
sina pe bhi azaan ka jo ehteraam reh gaya<br>
azaa'n jo reh gayi to phir (khuda ka naam reh gaya)..(2)<br>
jo goonjti hai aaj tak wohi azaa'n hussain hai<br>
<br>
7. Shaheed ran mein hogaye sabhi azeez o aqraba<br>
payam e marg ban gayi tamam arz e nainawa<br>
lahu pehen ke sogaya hussain ka to qafela<br>
hussain ka safar magar (na karbala mein ruk saka)..(2)<br>
wo dekh baad e karbala sar e sina hussain hai<br>
<br>
8. Jo teen din ki pyaas mein tadap gay shahadatein<br>
lahu se surkh hogayi jo chand jaisi suratein<br>
sune to kis tarha sune batao ye riwayaatein<br>
bayaan kis tarha se ho (hussain ki museebatein)..(2)<br>
sarapa dard o karb ki bas ek fugha'n husssain hai<br>
<br>
9. Hilal zulm o jaur se fiza ye kya bhari nahi<br>
bohot kadi hai manzile ye waqt sar sari nahi<br>
sipahe shimr o saad ki kaha'n sitamgari nahi<br>
yazid to guzar gaya (yazidiyat mari nahi)..(2)<br>
yazidiyat ke waaste qaza e jaa'n hussain hai<br>
<br>
zamana aaj dekhle<br>
kaha'n kaha'n husssain hai<br>
hussain ya hussain..(2)<br>
